{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgmffVM5HNND7dhyEifkw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Avi'le... no, it's you. Listen, about that קרן השתלמות. I haven't decided anything. I'm going to ask you, or the clerk at the bank, before I sign anything. What stuck with me is that the employer puts in a lot: \"₪ 2,250 מהמעסיק\" a month against my \"₪ 750\", and there was a big \"+135,000\" above a yellow bar. That sounds good. But right next to it was \"−64,761\" in red with stripes, and that's where I stopped. Also, the money goes into \"מסלול מדד\" with \"S&P500\" written next to it. That's English letters and shares, not a deposit. So I'm not sure at all.\n\n**What I looked at, in order:**\n- **Screen 1:** The title \"קרן השתלמות\". It's money that \"המעסיק ואתם מפקידים\" (my employer and I put in), and after 6 years I can take it out \"בפטור ממס\" (without tax). That part I understood. If I take it out before 6 years, I pay tax.\n- **Screen 2:** \"למה משתמשים בזה\" (what people use it for). Then a row of buttons: \"אג\"ח ממשלתית\" (government bonds), which I know is safe, plus \"מזומן שקלי\" and \"S&P 500 מדד\". I didn't press anything.\n- **Screen 3:** The box where I was supposed to put my 30,000. It was cut off at the top of the screen, so I didn't see my number there. I did see \"תשואה בשנה 7\" (7% a year) and \"דמי ניהול 0.54\" (management fees). Then a chart with little coloured bars, and a big chart with 45,000, then +135,000, +21,218, the red −64,761, and at the end 136,457. I didn't add them up. The line above the bars said \"לפני 6 שנים: מס\" (before 6 years: tax), so I think the red is tax.\n- **Screen 4:** Small grey writing. I caught \"47% מס\" (47% tax) and that frightened me.\n- **Screens 5 and 6:** \"כמה זה עולה\" (what it costs). Management fees \"עד 2% בשנה\" (up to 2% a year). The table said \"אין\" (none) for \"דמי יציאה\" (exit fees). I tired here and didn't read further down.\n\n**Words I didn't understand:** \"מסלול\" (track), \"מדד\" (to me that's the price index on the news), \"S&P500\", \"דמי ניהול 0.54\" (a fee, but on what?). Also the little badges \"חוקים וכללים · 15\" and \"TXH-09\".\n\n**Hard to read:** The page is black with grey writing, and at the bottom of the box on screen 4 the small grey text was very hard to read. The colours in the chart are too close to tell apart: dark brown, yellow, green, the striped pink.\n\n**What bothered me:** The red minus. The English letters. And the fact that I don't know who is behind this \"מקור\" site. It isn't a bank I know."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1871,"cache_read_input_tokens":13525,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1871},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e2e5441a-089b-4820-b14b-19e8734b0827","uuid":"2776ad49-54f7-4a53-ae7d-6c339be3282f","timestamp":"2026-11-06T12:23:16.834Z","request_id":"req_011CgmffV6gnz5DvneDKctJ8"}
